{"id": "71b27e7cda20", "title": "t.txt", "filename": "t.txt", "created": 1793368292.771875, "words": 1416, "similarity": {"percent": 0.0, "exact_percent": 0.0, "paraphrase_percent": 0.0, "excluded_percent": 0.0, "sources": [], "web": {"enabled": false, "note": "Web check off. Set WEB_SOURCES=wikipedia,openalex (free) and/or brave (BRAVE_API_KEY) to enable."}}, "ai": {"probability": 0.01, "uncertainty": 0.07, "words": 1416, "score": -7.307, "verdict": "no_strong_signal", "verdict_text": "No strong AI-writing signal", "share_flagged": 0.0, "features": {"fk": -4.199, "dk": -2.458}, "thresholds": {"fpr_1pct": 0.44514817797117084, "fpr_2pct": -1.028449431847328}, "low_confidence": false, "models": {"classifier": "fakespot-roberta@2.0.0", "classifier2": "desklib-deberta@3.0.0", "calibration": "v3-fk+dk-and-20261030"}, "disclaimer": "AI-writing scores are statistical estimates, not proof. Detectors make mistakes, are known to flag non-native English writers more often, and can be wrong on short, formulaic or heavily edited text. Never use this score alone to make an academic-misconduct decision; review the evidence with the student."}, "sentences": [{"text": "# Originality Detector (MVP)", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "Self-hosted similarity (plagiarism) + AI-writing evidence checker for universities.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "English only in this MVP.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "No humanizer / detector-evasion features, by design.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "## Run", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "```bash", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "cd /workspace/detector && . .venv/bin/activate", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8100 # open http://localhost:8100", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "```", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "Fresh install: `./download_models.sh` (creates venv, installs requirements.txt, pre-downloads v2 models + v1 models for rollback).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "Env vars: `DETECTOR_MANIFEST_URL` (remote model manifest, http(s):// or file://), `WEB_SEARCH_API_KEY`", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "(legacy, unused); `WEB_SOURCES=wikipedia,openalex[,brave]` opt-in web-source check (`BRAVE_API_KEY` for brave), `DETECTOR_WORKERS` (default 2), `DETECTOR_DATA`, `DETECTOR_LIGHT=1` (no models; tests).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "## API", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| Method | Path | Purpose |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "|---|---|---|", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| POST | /api/submit (file, title, add_to_library) | queue PDF/DOCX/TXT, returns job_id |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| GET | /api/jobs/{id} | status + progress |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| GET | /api/reports/{id} , /api/reports/{id}/pdf | JSON / PDF report |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| POST/GET | /api/library | add reference doc / list library |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| POST | /api/appeals/{id} ; GET /api/appeals | appeal workflow |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| GET | /api/registry ; /api/calibration | manifest; evaluation history |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| POST | /api/registry/check , /update , /rollback | update mechanism |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "## Tests & evaluation", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "```bash", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "python -m pytest -q # fast tests (no models)", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "RUN_MODEL_TESTS=1 DETECTOR_LIGHT=0 python -m pytest -q tests/test_models.py", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "python eval/evaluate.py --n 150 [--apply] # v1 MAGE benchmark", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "python eval/build_dataset.py; python eval/run_features.py fakespot test # v2 eval set + features", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "python eval/eval_ai_v2.py; python eval/calibrate_v2.py fakespot fakespot-ai/roberta-base-ai-text-detection-v1 AI", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "python eval/build_sim_dataset.py; python eval/eval_similarity.py; python eval/winnow_grid.py", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "```", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "See RESEARCH_AND_DESIGN.md for research, architecture and measured results.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "## v2 results (measured 16 Oct 2026; real numbers only)", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "### AI-writing detection", "ai_prob": 0.075, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**Evaluation data:**", "ai_prob": 0.103, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Held-out test:** 1,500 texts (MAGE test + MAGE OOD GPT-4 + GPT-4-paraphrased + RAID stratified by model/attack).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "Long texts were cut to the first 400 words.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Calibration split:** 800 texts, used for thresholds.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **ESL / native human essays:** 91 TOEFL essays (Liang et al.), 248 ELLIPSE/Feedback-Prize ELL essays, 80 ICNALE essays and 88 native Hewlett essays.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Threshold method:** thresholds are chosen on the calibration split and then applied unchanged to the test and ESL sets.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "The test FPR can therefore differ from the 1%/2% target.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**Document-level results:**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| Detector (doc level, single pass \u2264512 tokens) | Test AUROC | TPR @1% FPR thr | TPR @2% FPR thr | Test FPR @1% / @2% thr | TOEFL FPR @1% / @2% thr |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "|---|---|---|---|---|---|", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| **v1** ensemble (distilgpt2 + HC3-RoBERTa) | 0.615 | 0.049 | 0.105 | 0.002 / 0.012 | 0.077 / 0.099 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| distilgpt2 log-prob alone | 0.668 | 0.291 | 0.377 | 0.032 / 0.078 | 0.055 / 0.121 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| SmolLM2-135M Binoculars (zero-shot) | 0.635 | 0.306 | 0.379 | \u2013 | \u2013 / 0.088 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| SmolLM2-135M Fast-DetectGPT (1-model) | 0.667 | 0.381 | 0.418 | \u2013 | \u2013 / 0.066 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| **fakespot-ai/roberta-base-ai-text-detection-v1 (promoted)** | **0.963** | **0.785** | **0.802** | 0.010 / 0.017 | 0.044 / 0.055 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| Logistic stack (fakespot + SmolLM features) | 0.963 | 0.785 | 0.802 | same as fakespot | 0.055 @2% |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| GBM stack | 0.962 | 0.753 | 0.797 | \u2013 | 0.066 @2% |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**Notes on these results:**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **ESL false-positive rate for the promoted model:**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- At the 1% threshold: ELLIPSE 0.0%, ICNALE 0.0%, TOEFL 4.4%, native Hewlett 0.0%.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- v1 at the same thresholds: ELLIPSE 2.0%, ICNALE 2.5%, TOEFL 7.7%.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Per-source AUROC (promoted model vs v1):**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| Source | Promoted | v1 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "|---|---|---|", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| MAGE test | 0.926 | 0.718 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| MAGE OOD GPT-4 | 0.989 | 0.909 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| MAGE GPT-4-paraphrased | 0.927 | 0.830 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| RAID | 0.995 | 0.645 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "The model's training data is undisclosed, so the RAID figure may be inflated by overlap.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Avoid a plain 0.5 probability cut-off.** With isotonic calibration fitted on the AI-heavy calibration split, a 0.5 cut-off flagged 69% of TOEFL essays (promoted model) and 100% (v1). v2 therefore uses FPR-targeted thresholds and class-balanced calibration.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**As deployed in the app:** documents are scored in ~300-word chunks with a word-weighted logit, plus ~3-sentence windows for highlighting (`eval/calibrate_v2.py`).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "Results on the first 600 test texts, with the ESL set:", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Document level:**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- AUROC 0.983.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- At the 1% threshold: TPR 0.891, test FPR 0.036, TOEFL FPR 12.1%.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- At the 2% threshold: TPR 0.901, test FPR 0.042, TOEFL FPR 14.3%.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Window level (2,114 test windows):**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- AUROC 0.926.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- At the 1% threshold: TPR 0.446, FPR 0.004.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- At the 2% threshold: TPR 0.575, FPR 0.013.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Window FPR at the 2% threshold on ESL: TOEFL 3.8%, ICNALE 2.4%, ELLIPSE 0.5%.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Speed:**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Classifier only: ~0.8\u20131.3 s per 1,000 words.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- With highlighting windows: 3.95 s per 1,000 words, measured while other jobs shared the CPU.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **TOEFL false positives stay well above the 1\u20132% target.** Treat AI flags as prompts for a conversation, not as evidence.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**Promoted or rejected:**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Promoted:** fakespot RoBERTa, as the single classifier with FPR thresholds.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "The stacks were no better, so the simpler model won.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Rejected (measured):**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- The v1 ensemble.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- SmolLM2-135M Binoculars and Fast-DetectGPT: too weak at this model size.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- The GBM stack.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Not finished (CPU time):**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Qwen2.5-0.5B pair: 8.8 s per 1,000 words, dropped.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- desklib DeBERTa-v3-large (MIT, trained on RAID): ~7.7 s per 1,000 words, partial features only, not evaluated.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- DeBERTa-v3-small fine-tune: the first run hit an fp16 NaN; the fixed fp32 run was stopped before finishing.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "### Similarity", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**Evaluation data:** a synthetic PAN-style set built from Wikipedia (CC BY-SA).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Library:** 2,479 documents (all sources plus 2,000 distractors).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Documents:** 100 dev and 200 test documents, with 1,004 plagiarised test sentences.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Obfuscation types:** verbatim, light edits, back-translation (opus-mt en\u2192de\u2192en) and light edits plus sentence shuffling.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Also included:** quoted-and-cited passages and reference lists.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Thresholds** were tuned on dev.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| Config (test) | Precision | Recall | F1 | Recall: verbatim / light / backtransl. / shuffle | Quoted flagged | Bibliography flagged | Check s/1000 words |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| **v1** MiniLM, thr 0.82, no exclusions | 0.947 | 0.920 | 0.933 | 0.974 / 0.896 / 0.899 / 0.907 | 14/60 | 4/220 | 0.55 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| MiniLM + exclusions + common-phrase filter | 0.961 | 0.914 | 0.937 | 0.963 / 0.896 / 0.891 / 0.903 | 3/60 | 0/220 | 0.56 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| bge-small-en-v1.5 | 0.946 | 0.948 | 0.947 | 0.963 / 0.939 / 0.946 / 0.944 | 3/60 | 0/220 | 0.95 |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "| **e5-small-v2 (promoted), thr 0.92** | **0.960** | **0.947** | **0.953** | 0.963 / 0.939 / 0.938 / 0.948 | 2/60 | 0/220 | 2.96* |", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "\\*Measured while other experiments ran in parallel, so timings are inflated and noisy.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "The gte-small, e5+k4w3 and bge+k4w3 runs were stopped before finishing.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**Winnowing grid (exact channel only, test F1):**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- v1 setting (k=5, w=4, coverage 0.3): **0.745**.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Best on dev (k=4, w=3, coverage 0.2): **0.832** (precision 0.881, recall 0.788).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Not promoted: it was never measured together with the embedding channel, and it lowers exact-channel precision.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "**Other v2 changes:**", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- FAISS vector index (exact inner product), persisted, with re-embedding when the registry switches embedding model.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Document-frequency whitelist for common phrases.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Quote and bibliography exclusion.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- The report shows the matched source passage.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- Opt-in web-source check (`WEB_SOURCES=wikipedia,openalex`, both free with no key, or `brave` with `BRAVE_API_KEY`).", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "It was verified live against Wikipedia.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Not done:** the 12k-document and 100+ page throughput test.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "The script is `eval/throughput.py`, but it was not run before the stop.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "### Registry", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Manifest v2 actives:** `fakespot-roberta@2.0.0`, calibration `v2-fakespot-20261016`, similarity `e5-small-w5@2.0.0`.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- **Rollback:** `POST /api/registry/rollback` restores the v1 detectors, calibration and similarity settings.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "This is tested, and the library re-embeds on rollback.", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "## v3 (2026-10-30) \u2014 active", "ai_prob": 0.074, "ai_flag": false, "excluded": null, "exact": null, "paraphrase": null}, {"text": "- AI writing: fakespot RoBERTa